/Title (Two scenarios were developed, which differ mainly in how many schools they close. A scenario that closes fewer schools affects fewer families and changes fewer boundaries, but leaves more schools below the enrollment at which a school can offer stable, fully resourced programming. A scenario that closes more schools does the reverse.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 593 0 R
/Prev 693 0 R
